{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9a39575d45afc0148ffd154acdc12804766183ff7bff34c0dda4d46a86246b94","ja":"全力のぶつかり合い","zh":"全力碰撞","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"390b09ad83046c0e571529f1c075a749b4d7f0e85bbb1c1aba64a66cd48b4667","ja":"「ふたりが私のために争う姿なんてもう見たくない！\n仲のよかった頃に戻ってよ……！」","zh":"“我再也不想看到你们两个为了我而争吵了！\n回到以前感情要好的时候吧……！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d8b1099c30b128f8adf03fb8ef77f597d3ac64e2dffc5ef60daef24102954ebf","ja":"（ええっ！　そんな感じでくるんだ……！\nじゃ、じゃあ……オレはっ！）","zh":"（诶！居然是这种套路……！\n那、那我……就用这个！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"11ff0b6650a313f7de402ddf0cfc6604e834a4418d50a7f4a48319bdfac0a62c","ja":"「……ごめん。君のお願いは叶えてあげたいけど、\nこれだけは無理なんだ！」","zh":"“……对不起。虽然我很想实现你的愿望，\n但唯独这件事我做不到！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9045b7467b19c629d9da2cbca7071c7f1057248c1d3fc6d1fb703a6cf137ecf9","ja":"「っ……！　そんな、どうして！？」","zh":"「唔……！怎么会，为什么！？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5f5bf64e98ae8a7b169e5bf7b17f8dba024565054bb283dd552c6bc361ba98c6","ja":"「あいつに負けて君を奪われたオレは……\nやっと気づけたんだ！　君が大切な存在だって！」","zh":"「输给他、被夺走你的我……\n终于意识到了！你对我而言是多么重要的存在！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"209fd82af12da5b8d8e63b53097a64d774aefec3c653a64b545a0e593c9b4db4","ja":"「だからオレは、あいつに勝たなきゃ\nいけないんだ！　君を取り戻すために！」","zh":"“所以我必须赢过那家伙！\n为了把你夺回来！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6f941b2bb857bc6f4809deedb974bd7c03d87e70ffd2e578ffe6fe627ce81a52","ja":"「い……今更気づいたところで、もう遅い！\nこの子を悲しませた時点で、貴様には失望している！」","zh":"「事……事到如今才察觉到，也已经太迟了！\n在她为你伤心的那一刻起，我就对你彻底失望了！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"16fb3d9905298e303b3b02f37a8f921b4541b77e79462626ed7c7afae3c4e20d","ja":"「貴様には勝利も彼女も絶対に渡さん！\n何度立ち上がっても無駄だと教えてやろう！」","zh":"「胜利和她，我都绝不会交给你！\n不管你站起来多少次，我都会让你明白这只是徒劳！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c785652b5ea8a1d12c4021387df42b6a6dcfed19ff4b4364ac3a4a452332fb1d","ja":"「俺は変わったんだ！　もう迷わない！\nお前に勝って、今度こそ彼女に優勝を……！」","zh":"「我已经变了！不会再迷茫了！\n战胜你，这次一定要把优胜献给她……！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7fb56db111a2895e94a96a15fa7ace38eed155ccd9f158dd10a8c07e452cff53","ja":"さっきのエチュード、すっげー面白かったな♪\nまさかあんな展開になっちまうなんて！","zh":"刚才的即兴表演，真是超级有趣啊♪\n真没想到会变成那种发展！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"66f294f4946384f0b727a553b053f38afce683b31ae15925002a4cd965114f0f","ja":"ふふ、そうですわね。あの方、たった一言で自分を\n話の中心に据えてしまって、すごかったですわ。","zh":"呵呵，是啊。那位仅凭一句话就让自己\n成为了话题的中心，真是太厉害了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ae6caf3ec59b028d32a2fa502da16e392e13a8d6730f9a2997d6124cf9e958ae","ja":"審査で全力でぶつかり合ってさ……\nなんか、真珠星となる達みたいだったよな～。","zh":"在审查中全力以赴地互相碰撞……\n总觉得就像《真珠星的她们》一样呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3ce728391e95f57a62f0f066077441dac13f1295da6ea466093762b7e58d61e0","ja":"あいつらみたいに、これからも仲間として\nライバルとして、上を目指していこうぜ！","zh":"像他们那样，今后也作为伙伴、\n作为对手，一起向上攀登吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"69bbcbed4d84398ff93337866ba7744cdeb2c3b61b0b02bb90678d0a66ff051c","ja":"ええ、もちろんですわ！\nわたくしも、昴以上の高みへ至ってみせますわよ！","zh":"当然，那是自然！\n我也会攀登至超越昴的境界给您看的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
